Error [E0320]: Struct construction uses `Regex{…}`, not `Regex.{…}`
  --> tests/ui/dsl_blocks/regex_typed_head_owns_backslashes_but_rejects_holes.jet:4:22
    |
  4 |     pattern :: Regex.{"\d+{name}"}
    |                      ^
 Why: Literal heads place no dot before their brace (D-LIT-DOT1)
 Fix: Write `Regex{…}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0320

Error [E0152]: A `Regex` literal cannot contain interpolation
  --> regex_typed_head_owns_backslashes_but_rejects_holes.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     pattern :: Regex.{"\d+{name}"}
    |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The compiler must know the complete pattern before the program runs
 Fix: Use a fixed `Regex.{"..."}` pattern, or build text and call `re.compile(text)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0152
